Simulated Concentration-time profiles for drugX metabolized by CYP3A4 (B, E), drugX metabolized by CYP3A4 in liver (C, F) and drugX plasma concentration (A, D) for simulation of an 1mg iv application for an adult population (A, B, C) and simulation of an 5mg oral application for an adult population (D, E, F) on a logarithmic y-scale.
